  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 26a2998ef7acf0143a8fe0e00d8fd780, type: 3}
  m_Name: Barks_Woken
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.BarkSetSO
  _lines:
  - Do you have to stomp about like that? Some of us start work at dawn.
  - I was asleep, you know. Was, mind you.
  - Walk softer, will you? I've a shift in the morning and you've just cost me an hour of it.
  - What is it? Nothing? Then let a man sleep.
  - Can't anyone get a whole night's rest in this camp?
